WEBVTT

00:02:28.080 --> 00:02:30.496
you might actually be
more prepared than you think

00:02:30.520 --> 00:02:32.682
to make remote work work.

00:02:33.118 --> 00:02:35.618
(Music)

00:02:37.406 --> 00:02:40.239
(WorkLife theme music)

00:02:44.401 --> 00:02:45.552
AG: I'm Adam Grant,

00:02:45.576 --> 00:02:48.026
and this is "WorkLife,"
my podcast with TED.

00:02:48.050 --> 00:02:50.086
I'm an organizational psychologist.

00:02:50.110 --> 00:02:53.256
I study how to make work not suck.

00:02:53.280 --> 00:02:55.743
In this show, I'm inviting myself
inside the minds

00:02:55.767 --> 00:02:57.396
of some truly unusual people,

00:02:57.420 --> 00:03:00.751
because they've mastered something
I wish everyone knew about work.